%% RazorApp XR resource and secret flow
%% Paste this file into https://mermaid.live/

sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    participant U as User
    participant K8s as Kubernetes API
    participant XR as RazorApp XR
    participant Xp as Crossplane Composition
    participant SQL as provider-sql
    participant ESO as External Secrets Operator
    participant Vault as Vault KV projects/
    participant App as frontend Deployment/Pod

    U->>K8s: Apply namespace + RazorApp
    K8s->>XR: Create XR
    XR->>Xp: Reconcile with KCL composition

    rect rgb(235, 245, 255)
        Note over Xp,K8s: Crossplane creates app and database resources
        Xp->>K8s: Create ServiceAccount projectName-sa
        Xp->>K8s: Create Deployment frontend
        Xp->>K8s: Create Database projectName-db
        Xp->>K8s: Create User projectName-readonly-user
        Xp->>K8s: Create User projectName-readwrite-user
        Xp->>K8s: Create Grant for readonly user
        Xp->>K8s: Create Grant for readwrite user
    end

    rect rgb(245, 255, 235)
        Note over SQL,K8s: SQL provider generates database credentials
        K8s->>SQL: Reconcile Database and User resources
        SQL->>K8s: Write Secret projectName-readonly-user-secret
        SQL->>K8s: Write Secret projectName-readwrite-user-secret
    end

    rect rgb(255, 245, 235)
        Note over Xp,Vault: Crossplane prepares Vault access for secret push
        Xp->>K8s: Create Vault Policy projectName-eso-push-policy
        Xp->>K8s: Create Vault Token projectName-eso-token
        Xp->>K8s: Create ESO SecretStore using Vault token auth
        Xp->>K8s: Create PushSecret for RO credentials
        Xp->>K8s: Create PushSecret for RW credentials
    end

    rect rgb(255, 250, 220)
        Note over ESO,Vault: ESO pushes provider-sql secrets into Vault
        K8s->>ESO: Reconcile PushSecret resources
        ESO->>K8s: Read projectName-readonly-user-secret
        ESO->>Vault: Write projectName/database/ro-user
        ESO->>K8s: Read projectName-readwrite-user-secret
        ESO->>Vault: Write projectName/database/rw-user
    end

    rect rgb(245, 235, 255)
        Note over Xp,Vault: Crossplane prepares app read access to Vault
        Xp->>K8s: Create Vault Policy projectName-app-read-policy
        Xp->>K8s: Create Vault Kubernetes Auth Role projectName-app
        Xp->>K8s: Create ESO SecretStore using Kubernetes auth
        Xp->>K8s: Create ExternalSecret for RO credentials
        Xp->>K8s: Create ExternalSecret for RW credentials
    end

    rect rgb(235, 255, 245)
        Note over ESO,App: ESO reads Vault secrets back into app namespace
        K8s->>ESO: Reconcile ExternalSecret resources
        ESO->>Vault: Login with Kubernetes auth via app ServiceAccount
        Vault-->>ESO: Return scoped Vault token
        ESO->>Vault: Read projectName/database/ro-user
        ESO->>K8s: Create Secret database-user-ro
        ESO->>Vault: Read projectName/database/rw-user
        ESO->>K8s: Create Secret database-user-rw
    end

    rect rgb(240, 240, 240)
        Note over App,K8s: Application consumes the synced secret
        App->>K8s: Read envFrom Secret database-user-ro
        K8s-->>App: Inject endpoint, port, username, password
    end

    Note over App: Current deployment only mounts database-user-ro
